{"title":"What the Forest Keeps","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Nyra Fernsong says the treants wake when the old wood is gone, not when it&#39;s cut. Corwen Ash says his logging camp eats because of that same wood, and there is no answer that satisfies them both.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td>Nyra Fernsong</td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>23</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p class=\"g-note\">Not known yet: the data for this quest is incomplete.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to Nyra Fernsong to get the quest.</li></ol><p class=\"g-note\">The rest of the steps are still missing: the data for this quest is incomplete.</p></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>520</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>23,400</td></tr><tr><td>Lumberjack XP</td><td>400</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/shagbark-wood\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/27dcfbce89f072519264.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Wood</a> ×10<br><a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-wood\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/51227e67bd50e80d0a0c.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Wood</a> ×10</td></tr><tr><td>Choose one</td><td><a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-longbow\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/461e1d81d69de0d42fea.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Longbow</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-staff\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/ebc76f546f7e78794d2e.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Staff</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/gold-scimitar\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/412dedb82c179c2ec7d1.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Scimitar</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/tome-bowyer-black-walnut\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/55d5f302b2770d33049c.svg\" alt=\"\">Tome Bowyer Black Walnut</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>What the Forest Keeps</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-midland-what-the-forest-keeps\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-midland-what-the-forest-keeps\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-midland-what-the-forest-keeps\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-midland-what-the-forest-keeps\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}